{"title":"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, every beginning at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> equals twice the sum of the two numbers to its immediate left. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/783c4acddbbd6adaf969deaef09352900115571c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 50 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 70 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 80 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 100 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"452\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> using this fact:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51e22ab5992cf107dd1474e9bfe84c9d4f1a428.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(10 + a) = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e423a80b67e65d76c84598d1d91e1d4de3cb4bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 10 = \\frac{30}{2} = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e72e2e58a2ef8bb4eedd627c212f63bb8f507301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 5$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>We can now use this to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/3/a03d0b39a4bfeca8cc2347d8d25db7f39df0db50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2(5 + 30) = 2 \\times 35 = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"223\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Finding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/8/e9820082d49354cfced53cdd53ae6726fab395fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 2(30 + 70) = 2 \\times 100 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 200}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"295\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">2000 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 14</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal\">2000 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">Problem 13</a></b>\